Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: gpures
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3
Description: Trust-based GPU reservation CLI for shared Linux servers
 gpures provides a system-wide command for recording and viewing GPU
 reservations. It is intentionally trust-based: it does not enforce device
 access or alter process permissions.
